<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 73.4855 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 73.4855 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 73.4855 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday from 73.7094 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Dec 10		  Dec 9</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  73.4855		 73.7094</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	  7.450		   7.545</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom +8 3272 509410</p>
</text>
